# Reviewed exact-version input for the hash-locked backend environment
# (API + AI + development tooling combined).
#
# requirements*.txt declare the compatible version RANGES this project
# supports; this file pins the EXACT versions last verified to pass the full
# test suite. Regenerate requirements-lock.txt with:
#   venv\Scripts\python.exe ..\scripts\generate_python_lock.py
# A fresh `pip install --require-hashes -r requirements-lock.txt` reproduces
# that environment instead of re-resolving to whatever is newest-compatible
# on install day. Regenerate after intentionally upgrading a dependency and
# confirming `scripts\backend\check.py` and the test suite still pass.
#
# torch/torchvision/torchaudio are pinned separately (with a CUDA/CPU wheel
# index choice) by scripts\install-ai-models.bat -- included here only for
# a complete environment record, not to be installed from this file alone.
#
# Every non-comment line must remain an exact `name==version` pin.
